@startuml
actor User
participant WebApp as "React Web App"
participant Razorpay as "Razorpay Payment Gateway"
participant Backend as "FastAPI Backend"
database Supabase as "Supabase Postgres"

== Website Subscription Purchase ==
User -> WebApp : Click Upgrade to Pro
WebApp -> Backend : POST /billing/web/create-subscription
Backend -> Razorpay : API call: Create Subscription (Plan ID)
Razorpay --> Backend : Return subscription_id
Backend --> WebApp : Return payment info
WebApp -> Razorpay : Launch Checkout widget & User pays
Razorpay -> User : Process billing
Razorpay -> WebApp : Return razorpay_signature / razorpay_payment_id

WebApp -> Backend : POST /billing/web/verify-subscription
Backend -> Backend : Validate signature
Backend -> Supabase : UPDATE user subscription state & SET plan_type='pro'
Backend --> WebApp : Return subscription status (Unlock Pro)

== Razorpay Subscription Webhook ==
Razorpay -> Backend : POST /billing/razorpay/webhook (signature headers)
Backend -> Backend : Validate webhook authenticity
Backend -> Supabase : Update subscription expiration / status
Backend --> Razorpay : HTTP 200 OK
@enduml
